@startuml
title watch — Display watched values
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
actor "User" as U
participant "TerminalUI" as UI
participant "DebugSession" as S
participant "Inspection / instrumentation" as I
U -> UI : watch
UI -> S : Read watches
loop For each watched path
UI -> S : inspect(PATH)
S -> I : read_path(current_state(), PATH)
end
UI --> U : Result or command error; return to prompt
@enduml
